OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sexually assaulting
OL,4,Ayoung girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after sexually
OL,7,Fassaulting two young girls over several
OL,8,Fmonths.
OL,10,FMatthew North, 67, of Immingham, was
OL,11,Ffound guilty of inciting a female under
OL,12,F13 to engage in sexual activity and
OL,13,Ffour counts of assaulting a girl under
OL,14,F13 by touching.
OL,16,FHumberside Police said North's
OL,17,Foffending started in September 2025. He
OL,18,Fwas arrested in April this year and
OL,19,Fdenied the allegations.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
