OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sexually assaulting
OL,4,Ayoung girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe appeared at Grimsby Crown Court on
OL,7,FTuesday and was sentenced to 12 years
OL,8,Fbehind bars, with a further four years
OL,9,Fon licence. He was also given a
OL,10,Flifetime sexual harm prevention order.
